# Robber of the Rich: the defending player of an attack on a planeswalker is the planeswalker's controller (CR 506.2). On
# turn 2 Bot2 casts Dack Fayden (an Island and two Moxen pay) and uses its +1, leaving four cards in hand; on turn 3 Bot1
# plays a Mountain and a Mox Pearl, leaving three, and Robber (haste) attacks Dack Fayden. Bot2 has more cards in hand than Bot1,
# so the trigger exiles the top card of Bot2's library, an Island.

